Package: twc
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Benyvan <benyvan@gmail.com>
Depends: python3, python3-tk, iw, iproute2, aircrack-ng, policykit-1, network-manager
Description: Total Wireless Control graphical Wi-Fi interface manager
 TWC is a Python/Tkinter desktop application for managing local wireless
 interfaces, switching monitor and managed modes, and controlling
 NetworkManager. It requests graphical PolicyKit authentication once at
 startup, preserves the active desktop display session, then runs the
 application as root.
